    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really about \"starting anew\" though. that's just a nice way of putting it. i don't think there's anything left to start with. i look at my old work and i don't even recognize that person. it feels like that person died and i'm just the leftover shell. like there's no point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken and gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
